. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BYjYOaqGvLkQ7kNvwG4MnwI&_nc_oc=Adrpx6WvQtE_4g6Lp9fVhnjttthmGmwa4EQhFHTGPZpDcAnQS1U9CU9HkV1XbfN3SSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5N8feqQ57j29KPVOZgiMYtVR2SmfmTQtoRG2E5-DLS6w&oe=6A198E3E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mp1JBD4wN9sQ7kNvwEWeJ4A&_nc_oc=AdrMbU0R3R8KnoP2yzI5MiXQntUcL28CLnZms4RWcUdOX-VJuuCY6s_Hg9Yua0FF4oY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72tTLaYIuyf1WOzZW6ZtedeNfLRpc7SXsNRNaDhZpYMg&oe=6A19A4DE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiIjvMAQwtoQ7kNvwFeWE2D&_nc_oc=AdpKuJiWF4EHDavMVOdznWdR-1njbleTOgP7ITnL7GflroG5HjaI5gUovIv59DfaYz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4UHTCejrpOSNFLdjwdLJ4KJpOwBeo8AUWH4pL-QSPtQA&oe=6A199A5B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco